60
00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.120
BMW, BMW?

61
00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:58.520
On jah, sa mõtlesid
siis nagu vana rull on ka auto,

62
00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:01.170
