84
00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.080
No teha paigaldatud juhend.

85
00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.305
Okei.

86
00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.880
Kirjelduste järgi, mis,
mis me internetist enne lugesime, et

87
00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:39.500
