Aga midagi ei ole? Ei, mootorit meil

157
00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:40.850
ka on,

158
00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.510
mootorit meil ka on. Noh,
võib -olla on nii,

159
00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:47.150
